n>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"101. 對YouWare創始人明超平3小時訪談：今天Agent像大猩猩剛拿起一根燒火棍 per token valuation web coder agent rank the bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-05-28-zhangxiaojun-agent-像大猩猩刚拿起烧火棍-token-消耗速度才是关键指标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7a30891133f762c8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0528</span></div>\n<h2>Agent 像大猩猩剛拿起燒火棍，token 消耗速度才是關鍵指標</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">明超平把 AI 產品的關鍵指標從 DAU 換成 token 消耗速度，又進一步改成 per token valuation——因為 token 消耗大不代表價值高，就像石油轉化為機械能的效率才是關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">產品方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"100. 對話奔馳全球CEO康林松：轉型期CEO和轉型之中的139歲奔馳 MBOS L3 CLTC ECU\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-05-23-zhangxiaojun-奔驰ceo-2030年若市场不纯电-我们两种车都造/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae02e39916eeef4f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">57:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>奔馳CEO：2030年若市場不純電，我們兩種車都造</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">康林松不賭單一技術路線：堅持2030年前推出完整電動車序列，同時保留燃油和電動兩種選擇。他判斷中國是節奏最快、競爭壓力最大的市場，能在中國贏，在全球贏的概率就更高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車</span><span class=\"tag\">電動化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"99. 對能量奇點創始人楊釗3小時訪談：人類馴服可控核聚變還有多少路程？ Q值 三乘積 托卡馬克 高溫超導 FRC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-04-28-zhangxiaojun-聚变真正的原料不是氘氚-是氘氘/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e4068698af4899d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:34:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0428</span></div>\n<h2>聚變真正的原料不是氘氚，是氘氘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">氘氚路線要邊發電邊造氚，監管和成本都高；氘氘不涉氚，才是規模化商業電站的前提，但三乘積要從21次方再上一個數量級。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可控核聚變</span><span class=\"tag\">高溫超導</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"98. 逐篇講解機器人基座模型和VLA經典論文——“人就是最智能的VLA” VLA Action Chunking Transformer Model Predictive Control Co-Fine Tuning Diffusion Policy Unified Action Space\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-04-06-zhangxiaojun-机器人不需要等到-aha-moment-才落地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ebe187bae6eda636-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:29:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0406</span></div>\n<h2>機器人不需要等到 aha moment 才落地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">機器人領域還沒出現大模型那種 aha moment，但能力提升的斜率已經起來了，每一年每一個月的能力增長都會沿途解鎖新的商業機會，不用等通用智能成熟再找應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">機器人</span><span class=\"tag\">VLA</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"97. 25年Q1大模型季報：和廣密聊當下最大非共識、AGI的主線與主峰 Pretraining Post Training RL Tool Use Long Context Online Learning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-30-zhangxiaojun-预训练才是主峰-智能本身就是最大的应用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c27ae452558c5f81-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0330</span></div>\n<h2>預訓練才是主峰：智能本身就是最大的應用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型公司是煉油廠，值錢的是化工廠和汽車公司；但今天最大的紅利是承接研究溢出的智能，而不是做產品拉動的應用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">預訓練</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"96. 和郎鹹朋聊，自動駕駛10年演進史、關鍵技術細節和特斯拉 BEV Transformer VLM MPI VLA 3DGS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-16-zhangxiaojun-l3-不是-l2-的延长-而是-l4-的先导/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46bac62b6c4b8b63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0316</span></div>\n<h2>L3 不是 L2 的延長，而是 L4 的先導</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">理想自動駕駛團隊用端到端把 200 萬行代碼砍到 20 萬行，縱向控制第一次超過所有競品——不是人更聰明，是終於用做能力而不是做功能的方式做自動駕駛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">端到端</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"95. 對Manus創始人肖弘的3小時訪談：世界不是線性外推，做博弈中的重要變量 Andy-Bill 定律 Agentic Yolo 模式 PMF GAIA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-03-02-zhangxiaojun-世界不是线性外推-做博弈里那个重要变量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/766e33c00e9ce2db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:22:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0302</span></div>\n<h2>世界不是線性外推：做博弈裡那個重要變量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果世界是邏輯推導，今天最大的推薦引擎公司是百度。肖弘說創業者要做的不是推演必然，而是讓自己成為改變博弈結果的那個變量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"94. 逐篇講解DeepSeek、Kimi、MiniMax注意力機制新論文——“硬件上的暴力美學” NSA (Native Sparse Attention) MoBA (Mixture of Block Attention) GQA (Group Query Attention) Lightning Attention trunkwise tensor core\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-23-zhangxiaojun-deepseek-用暴力美学改架构-把-full-attention-全线压制了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e13a783fb7c67a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:36:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0223</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 用暴力美學改架構，把 Full Attention 全線壓制了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">動態稀疏注意力過去只能加速推理，DeepSeek 第一次拿它從頭預訓練，損失曲線和下游評測全線壓過 Full Attention——稀疏注意力不再只是省錢的補丁。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">注意力機制</span><span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"93. 離開字節、MiniMax的張前川，發出AGI對人類威脅的預警 PageRank PGC baby AGI UBI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-20-zhangxiaojun-agi-是人类的最后一个发明-但-95-的公司在踩油门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0671266ee01a3b9e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:07:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0220</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是人類的最後一個發明，但 95% 的公司在踩油門</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">張前川把人類文明比作開出 1 萬公里的車，AGI 是最後一公里：前方可能是更寬的公路，也可能是懸崖。而絕大多數 AI 公司正在做的是瘋狂踩油門。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">內容分發</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"92. 和張亞勤院士聊，意識、壽命、機器人、生物智能和物種的延伸 RS2 corner case end-to-end world model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-17-zhangxiaojun-张亚勤-信息智能五年到顶-人形机器人还要十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af271912f6614eec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">53:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0217</span></div>\n<h2>張亞勤：信息智能五年到頂，人形機器人還要十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把 AGI 拆成信息、物理、生物三層：信息智能五年內達到人類水平，但那是大腦的智商；讀萬卷書仍不會游泳，物理智能才剛開場。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"91. 逐篇講解DeepSeek關鍵9篇論文及創新點——“勇敢者的遊戲” MoE MLA MTP FP8 PPO rule-based reward\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-11-zhangxiaojun-deepseek-用-2000-张卡训出-671b-模型-靠的是敢赌没人做过的技/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e697ec31e81cd26-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">3:20:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0211</span></div>\n<h2>DeepSeek 用 2000 張卡訓出 671B 模型，靠的是敢賭沒人做過的技術</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 的每一步創新都是被成本逼出來的：從 MoE 到 MLA 到 FP8 訓練，別人不敢在大規模上試的東西，他們試了，而且一次訓完沒回滾。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>17</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">DeepSeek</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"90. 朱嘯虎又來了：中國現實主義AIGC故事的1週年連載 Scaling Law RL DAU PMF Capex\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-07-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎改口-deepseek-让他快信-agi-了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd200744fc07602d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0207</span></div>\n<h2>朱嘯虎改口：DeepSeek 讓他快信 AGI 了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一年前他說絕不投任何一家中國大模型公司，如今他說如果梁文鋒開放融資「我肯定會投」，價格已經不太重要，關鍵是參與見證人類 AGI 和 AI 意識的產生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">開源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"89. 逐句講解DeepSeek-R1、Kimi K1.5、OpenAI o1技術報告——“最優美的算法最乾淨” GRPO reward hacking PRM MCTS distillation curriculum sampling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-02-04-zhangxiaojun-r1-最值钱的不是模型-是那个-aha-moment/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/acc6341cf0407e5d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:49:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0204</span></div>\n<h2>R1 最值錢的不是模型，是那個 aha moment</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepSeek 把 O1 出的謎語第一個解開了：不用人教，模型自己在強化學習裡學會反思和糾錯。R1-Zero 比 R1 更乾淨，但 R1 才是能用的那個。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">後訓練</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"88. 和吳翼技術解讀OpenAI Operator：推理從抽象世界走向物理世界的開端 CUA GUI agent close loop system OS World\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-24-zhangxiaojun-operator-不是-o3-的延续-是推理伸向物理世界的第一只手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/55d0a72f1e4b0469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0124</span></div>\n<h2>Operator 不是 O3 的延續，是推理伸向物理世界的第一隻手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 2016 年做 Web Agent 失敗並裁掉二三十人，缺的是基座模型；十年後 Operator 把基座模型、人類數據和強化學習三件事湊齊，才讓推理從抽象文本走向視覺交互。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"87. 對李想的3小時訪談（播客版）：宅男、AI、家庭、遊戲和天梯 VLA VLM MPI BLM DT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2025-01-02-zhangxiaojun-李想-汽车是物理世界ai最大的应用-但l4门票要三样东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d61119d6a5d51c08-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">2:53:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0102</span></div>\n<h2>李想：汽車是物理世界AI最大的應用，但L4門票要三樣東西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他把AI產品分三段：增強能力、成為助手、成為家人。今天連第一段都沒做好，所以真正的競爭還沒開始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI產品</span><span class=\"tag\">智能駕駛</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"86. 大模型季報年終特輯：和廣密預言LLM產品超越Google之路 Long Horizon Task MCP Data Wall Reward Model K-Lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-22-zhangxiaojun-下一个google不是搜索-是任务引擎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1d93d02a587ff35f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1222</span></div>\n<h2>下一個Google不是搜索，是任務引擎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ChatGPT、Anthropic、Perplexity 形態各異，但都在爭奪同一件事：重新組織信息與任務。搜索和推薦融合成任務引擎，誰掌握 context 誰就贏。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"85. 與總統競選成員聊，總統候選人與美國敘事如何PMF？ Product Market Fit Voter Registration Early Voting Tracker Deregulation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-15-zhangxiaojun-总统大选就是给候选人找-pmf-产品不行谁也救不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1644e0aa04895839-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1215</span></div>\n<h2>總統大選就是給候選人找 PMF，產品不行誰也救不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大選團隊是短期內 scale up 最快的組織，但產品（候選人）已經定了，能做的只是把產品和整個國家的環境做 product market fit。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國大選</span><span class=\"tag\">PMF</span>\n</div></div></a>"]